                    "message": "nit, this may be confusing in the logs because the same message is printed above around LINE 548 for non-GET non-Collection requests.  In the above case we return early and here we keep processing normally."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/include/redfish_aggregator.hpp",
                    "line": 579,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Changed the log. PTAL"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/include/redfish_aggregator.hpp",
                    "line": 579,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Carson",
                        "email": "clabrado@google.com",
                        "username": "carsonlab"
                    },
                    "message": "The wording is awkward now.  There should already be debug messages denoting the type of aggregation request and what the URI is.\n\nI think all we really need to log in this new code is if we erased a param.\n\nHow do you feel about deleting this log and instead adding a log like\n```\nBMCWEB_LOG_DEBUG(\"Erasing \\\"{}\\\" param from request to top level collection\", param.key);\n```\n\nor even\n```\nBMCWEB_LOG_DEBUG(\"Can't forward query param \\\"{}\\\" to top level collections\", param.key);\n```\n\nto inside of here?\n```\n                if (param.key == \"only\" || param.key == \"$skip\")\n                {\n                    paramsIt = urlNew.params().erase(paramsIt);\n                    continue;\n                }\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/include/redfish_aggregator.hpp",
                    "line": 579,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Did exactly as you suggested in the newest patchset."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/include/redfish_aggregator.hpp",
                    "line": 579,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Carson",
                        "email": "clabrado@google.com",
                        "username": "carsonlab"
                    },
                    "message": "SG"
                }
            ],
